==Battleground==
*1 [[Relic Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*4 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*10 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is relatively simple, having any [[:Category:Anti-Relic Cats|anti-Relic Cats]] at all will make it extremely easy. [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] can also solo the level on their own at level 50.

